---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();

const socialLinks = [
  {
    name: "Facebook",
    href: "https://www.facebook.com/teamemailrakyat",
  },
  {
    name: "Instagram",
    href: "https://www.instagram.com/teamemailrakyat/",
  },
  {
    name: "TikTok",
    href: "https://www.tiktok.com/@teamemail.rakyat?is_from_webapp=1&sender_device=pc",
  },
  {
    name: "YouTube",
    href: "https://www.youtube.com/@emailrakyat",
  },
  {
    name: "Email",
    href: "https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=aduan@e-rakyat.com",
  },
  {
    name: "LinkedIn",
    href: "https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/email-rakyat/",
  }
];

const securityFeatures = [
  { name: "HTTPS / TLS Encryption", status: "ACTIVE", color: "text-emerald-400" },
  { name: "HSTS Protection", status: "ENFORCED", color: "text-emerald-400" },
  { name: "X-Frame Anti-Clickjack", status: "DENY", color: "text-emerald-400" },
  { name: "Cloudflare Shield", status: "STANDBY", color: "text-amber-400" },
];
---

<footer class="bg-[var(--site-surface)] text-[var(--site-muted)] border-t border-[var(--site-line)] pt-16 pb-28 sm:pb-20 mt-auto relative z-30">
  <div class="site-container">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-[var(--site-line)]">
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--site-heading)] tracking-tight mb-2">
          Email Rakyat
        </h3>
        <p class="body-text text-xs max-w-md">
          Pusat advokasi dan khidmat nasihat hak pengguna di Malaysia. Membantu mangsa pinjaman tidak berlesen keluar daripada tekanan sindiket secara sah berlandaskan undang-undang statut negara.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-6 md:flex md:flex-col md:items-end">
        <span class="pill-accent mb-3">Saluran Rasmi</span>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs">
          {socialLinks.map((link) => (
            <a
              href={link.href}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-[var(--site-muted)] hover:text-[var(--site-accent)] font-medium transition-colors"
            >
              {link.name}
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="py-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-[var(--site-muted)] font-medium">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[var(--site-accent)] transition-colors">Utama</a>
        <a href="/panduan" class="hover:text-[var(--site-accent)] transition-colors">Panduan</a>
        <a href="/perkhidmatan" class="hover:text-[var(--site-accent)] transition-colors">Perkhidmatan</a>
        <a href="/tentang" class="hover:text-[var(--site-accent)] transition-colors">Tentang Kami</a>
        <a href="/berita" class="hover:text-[var(--site-accent)] transition-colors">Berita</a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs text-[var(--site-subtle)]">
        <button id="btn-privacy" class="hover:text-[var(--site-heading)] transition-colors focus:outline-none">Privasi</button>
        <button id="btn-terms" class="hover:text-[var(--site-heading)] transition-colors focus:outline-none">Terma</button>
        <button id="btn-security" class="hover:text-[var(--site-heading)] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          Status Sistem
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[var(--site-line)] text-[11px] text-[var(--site-subtle)] flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        &copy; {currentYear} Email Rakyat. Hak cipta terpelihara.
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-xl md:text-right leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-[var(--site-muted)] font-semibold">Identiti Khidmat:</strong> ER Advocacy Sdn Bhd merupakan sebuah platform perunding advokasi dan khidmat nasihat swasta berdaftar di Malaysia. Perkhidmatan kami adalah khidmat nasihat profesional berlandaskan undang-undang bagi membantu individu yang terkesan dengan pinjaman tidak berlesen (Ah Long) dan isu hutang secara sah.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <dialog id="modal-privacy" class="backdrop:bg-black/85 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm bg-transparent p-0 w-full max-w-2xl open:animate-fade-in m-auto border border-[var(--site-line)] rounded-xl shadow-2xl text-left"></dialog>
  <template id="template-privacy">
    <div class="relative bg-[#0d1526] text-slate-200 p-8 max-h-[80vh] overflow-y-auto rounded-xl">
        <button class="close-modal absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-2xl">&times;</button>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">Polisi Privasi <span class="text-[#e2b03a]">"Zero-Knowledge"</span></h3>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="text-white">1. Pengumpulan Data:</strong> Kami hanya mengumpul data yang anda berikan secara sukarela. Kami <strong>TIDAK</strong> menggunakan penjejak (trackers) pihak ketiga.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">2. Kerahsiaan:</strong> Maklumat anda tidak akan dijual kepada agensi kutipan hutang atau bank. Data anda disulitkan (Encrypted).</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">3. Pemadaman:</strong> Anda berhak memohon pemadaman rekod komunikasi pada bila-bila masa.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="close-modal mt-6 w-full bg-[#e2b03a] hover:bg-[#f0c351] text-[#070c18] font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Faham &amp; Tutup</button>
    </div>
  </template>

  <dialog id="modal-terms" class="backdrop:bg-black/85 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm bg-transparent p-0 w-full max-w-2xl open:animate-fade-in m-auto border border-[var(--site-line)] rounded-xl shadow-2xl text-left"></dialog>
  <template id="template-terms">
    <div class="relative bg-[#0d1526] text-slate-200 p-8 max-h-[80vh] overflow-y-auto rounded-xl">
        <button class="close-modal absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-2xl">&times;</button>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">Penafian &amp; <span class="text-[#e2b03a]">Syarat</span></h3>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="text-white">1. Bukan PDRM/Peguam:</strong> Email Rakyat adalah platform khidmat nasihat sosial. Kami bukan pengganti polis atau firma guaman.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">2. Tanggungjawab:</strong> Anda bersetuju memberikan maklumat benar. Laporan palsu tidak akan dilayan.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">3. Liabiliti:</strong> Kami tidak bertanggungjawab atas kerugian yang timbul. Sila rujuk peguam bertauliah untuk tindakan mahkamah.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="close-modal mt-6 w-full bg-[#e2b03a] hover:bg-[#f0c351] text-[#070c18] font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Setuju &amp; Tutup</button>
    </div>
  </template>

  <dialog id="modal-security" class="backdrop:bg-black/85 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm bg-transparent p-0 w-full max-w-2xl open:animate-fade-in m-auto border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl shadow-2xl text-left"></dialog>
  <template id="template-security">
    <div class="relative bg-[#070c18] text-slate-200 p-8 max-h-[80vh] overflow-y-auto rounded-xl">
        <button class="close-modal absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-2xl">&times;</button>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">
             <span class="relative flex h-3.5 w-3.5">
                <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
                <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-3.5 w-3.5 bg-emerald-500"></span>
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest">System Operational</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 mb-6">
            {securityFeatures.map(feature => (
                <div class="bg-[#0d1526] p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center">
                    <span class="text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs uppercase">{feature.name}</span>
                    <span class={`font-mono font-bold text-[10px] border px-2 py-0.5 rounded ${feature.color} border-current`}>
                        {feature.status}
                    </span>
                </div>
            ))}
        </div>

        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 text-center">
            Dilindungi Penyulitan Data (TLS 1.3 &amp; Akta PDPA) <br />
            Server Node: Netlify Edge (Global)
        </div>

        <button class="close-modal mt-6 w-full border border-emerald-500/50 text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-slate-950 font-mono font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors text-xs uppercase">Tutup Status Keselamatan</button>
    </div>
  </template>

</footer>

<script is:inline src="/scripts/secure-core.js" defer></script>
<style>
  dialog[open] { animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95); } to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }
</style>
